{"unit_id":"xiaoran0829__dsh-session-deliverables#card-zh","repo":"xiaoran0829/dsh-session-deliverables","commit":"16f89fc115e53bd36e01fb0285a6df2ff8c79628","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deliverables 是 DSH Web 插件，在每个会话顶栏加入「文件」视图，并为原生文档预览提供下载按钮。它读取会话日志中由 present 声明的交付物，可选扫描会话期间生成的工作区文档和媒体，并以附件形式提供文件下载。适合需要查找、核对或保存 DSH 会话产出的用户；安装后需重启 Web profile，插件没有配置项。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:271-313","index.js:411-445","client.js:237-357"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoran0829__dsh-session-deliverables#card-en","repo":"xiaoran0829/dsh-session-deliverables","commit":"16f89fc115e53bd36e01fb0285a6df2ff8c79628","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-deliverables adds a Files view to DSH Web sessions and a download action to document previews. It lists files declared through present, can include session workspace documents and media, and lets users download them as attachments. No settings are needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:271-313","index.js:411-445","client.js:237-357"]}
