{"unit_id":"xiaoran0829__dsh-session-deliverables#feature-1","repo":"xiaoran0829/dsh-session-deliverables","commit":"16f89fc115e53bd36e01fb0285a6df2ff8c79628","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deliverables 的功能「会话交付物列表」：在会话顶栏提供文件视图，按会话日志中的 present 声明列出交付文件，并显示文件名、路径、大小和时间。用户可刷新列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:271-313","index.js:411-445","client.js:237-357"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoran0829__dsh-session-deliverables#feature-2","repo":"xiaoran0829/dsh-session-deliverables","commit":"16f89fc115e53bd36e01fb0285a6df2ff8c79628","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deliverables 的功能「附件下载」：在文件列表点击文件即可下载；服务端返回附件响应，并按文件扩展名设置内容类型和文件名。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:271-313","index.js:411-445","client.js:237-357"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoran0829__dsh-session-deliverables#feature-3","repo":"xiaoran0829/dsh-session-deliverables","commit":"16f89fc115e53bd36e01fb0285a6df2ff8c79628","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deliverables 的功能「工作区成果补充」：勾选“含工作区成果”后，列表可加入会话工作区中新建的文档、媒体和压缩包，并限制扫描范围与预算。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:271-313","index.js:411-445","client.js:237-357"]}
